# 只把镜像构建所需文件交给 Docker。
**
!requirements.lock
!app/
!app/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!scripts/
!scripts/serve.py
!scripts/init_db.py
!scripts/init_checkpoints.py
!deploy/
!deploy/s6/
!deploy/s6/ai-api/
!deploy/s6/ai-api/**
!deploy/s6-user-bundles/
!deploy/s6-user-bundles/user/
!deploy/s6-user-bundles/user/contents.d/
!deploy/s6-user-bundles/user/contents.d/ai-api

# 即使位于允许目录中，也不发送本地依赖、产物或密钥。
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/frontend/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[codz]
**/.env*
**/config.yml
**/config.ui.yml
**/secrets.ui.yml
**/admin.users.yml
**/admin.bootstrap.txt
**/*.pid
**/*.runtime.json
